{"slug":"hakuouki","anilist":6895,"ad":"Hakuouki","adEn":"Hakuoki ~Demon of the Fleeting Blossom~","yil":2010,"puan":68,"format":"TV","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"SPRING","sure":23,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/3/71800.jpg","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6895-80ov7fZRCJam.jpg","banner4k":null,"banner4kGenislik":null,"bannerTmdb":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j1563JCbS2VGulDWPU6kocvg5pY.jpg","bannerTmdbGenislik":1920,"ozet":"The protagonist, Yukimura Chizuru, is the daughter of a doctor who works in Edo. The father leaves Edo to work as a volunteer doctor and moves to Kyoto without his daughter. As time passes by, Chizuru starts worrying about losing contact with her father, so she decides to go to Kyoto in search of him. On the way, Chizuru is attacked by few criminals and witnesses a fight between an oni and the Shinsengumi. Taking her into custody and saving her, the Shinsengumi debate on what to do with Chizuru when they discover that she is the daughter of the doctor they are also looking for. So they decide to become Chizuru's protectors and help her look for her father (the doctor). Lots of events happen while she stays with the Shinsengumi, as they discover mysterious secrets and also fight against the Bakumatsu group. The story is overall romantic with a historical and political background. \n\n(Source: Hakuouki official website)","turler":["Aksiyon","Dram","Doğaüstü","Tarihi","Vampir","Kadın Başrol"],"iliski":[{"t":"PREQUEL","s":"hakuouki-reimeiroku","ad":"Hakuoki ~Demon of the Fleeting Blossom~ Dawn of the Shinsengumi","p":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx13115-EgBCyO9pmicg.jpg","f":"TV"},{"t":"SEQUEL","s":"hakuouki-hekketsuroku","ad":"Hakuoki ~Demon of the Fleeting Blossom~ Record of the Jade Blood","p":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx9065-LKMdqEOGvMr7.png","f":"TV"},{"t":"SIDE_STORY","s":"hakuouki-sekkaroku","ad":"Hakuoki: Dem